Releases poisonous spores at an area of radius [1, 1, 2, 2, 2 (TL1-5)], infecting the foes inside with a random poison doing [242, 326, 391, 446, 495 (TL1-5; MP 100)] Nature damage over 10 turns.

This attack can crit and deals [22%, 30%, 36%, 41%, 46% (TL1-5; MP 100)] additional critical damage.

The damage and critical bonus increase with your Mindpower.
